AoT_C2Rivals:
UNIT AoT_Cadet AoT_ClsCadet 0 Level(3,NPC,1) [26,19] 0 [AoT_ItemTrainingID,0,0,0] [0,0,0,0]
UNIT AoT_Cadet AoT_ClsCadet 0 Level(3,NPC,1) [27,19] 0 [AoT_ItemTrainingID,0,0,0] [0,0,0,0]
UNIT AoT_Cadet AoT_ClsCadet 0 Level(3,NPC,1) [28,19] 0 [AoT_ItemTrainingID,0,0,0] [0,0,0,0]
UNIT

